    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d912">

                <pb facs="0987" n="701" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg701"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111So4/72</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        French Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Jusserand</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 28, 1915</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: The Department has been
                    informed of what you have, no doubt, seen in the press, that Second Lieutenant
                        William Thaw, Sergeant Elliot
                        Cowdin and Sergeant Norman
                    Prince of the French Army Flying Corps arrived in New York on December 23d on
                    the Holland-America liner <hi rendition="#italic">Rotterdam</hi>. As it appears
                    that these gentlemen are in the active service of the armed forces of your
                    Government, I would be pleased if you could find it possible to inform me as to
                    whether this is true, and as to their purpose in thus visiting this country. I
                    am desirous of having this information in the interest of protecting the
                    neutrality of the United States.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
